  "description": {
    "text": "The 2013 Pokémon World Championships, held from 9 to 11 August 2013 at the Vancouver Convention Centre, the first outside the United States. Competitors got the first Champions Festival in seven languages, staff a Staff copy, and top finishers copies stamped with their placing from Top Thirty-Two up to Champion.\n\nThis year added a No. 4 Trainer, so the top four of each division received trophy cards; it was the last year of the trophy picture first used in 2004.",
